model probes
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "review probes"

source card "invented"

input wr: date

version spring
  cite card
  governs 2026-01-01..2026-03-31
  known 2026-01-01
  wr = window(2026-06-01, 2026-06-05) "c"

ask l1: last(wr, 2026-07-01) == last(wr, 2026-07-01)
ask l2: last(wr, 2026-07-01) < last(wr, 2026-07-01), last(wr, 2026-07-01) <= last(wr, 2026-07-01)
ask l3: last(wr, 2026-07-01)
